<<~ ahu #/head>>

! Kai ʻĀ ~ Prismatic Elf Warrior-Ranger, Kaiju Stalker

''The held name:'' ''Kai ʻĀ'' — "Sea; Fiery, burning, or to
glitter and sparkle like a gem or star." The player's own name carried into the fiction and
lit from within — sea-water and gem-fire in two syllables, which reads as the prismatic
condition itself.

''Archetype'' (company canon, `campaign/company-structure.mem`): ''Prismatic Elf
Warrior-Ranger Kaiju Stalker'' — Hunter / Fighter / Arcane-Archer. Company function:
long-range scouting, overwatch, wilderness tracking, monster-scale threat assessment.
Her mount, ''Patches'' the grimalkin-lynx, rides in her own meme:
[[the-grimalkin|lar:///ha.ka.ba/elyncia/characters/primary-characters/the-grimalkin]].

''Lifepath:'' OPEN — closes at the Session 0.1 table by lifepath-life talk-story,
co-narrated in-scene. Nothing below pre-empts what Kai speaks there.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/the-build>>

!! The Build

''Elf + Affinity – Illusion • Light • Void'' — the blessed construction for "prismatic elf":

* ''Elf heritage'' (FTLS `03:684–706`): Skilled = Quick + Darkvision + Lucky · Expert =
  ''Affinity – Illusion • Light • Void'' · Master = Psi-Speech.
* ''The license'' (`03:127`, verbatim): "Weave fae-charms and reality edits, bend radiance and
  reflection, or veil yourself in void-glamours. ''Illusion includes prismatic glamour'' and the
  push-pull of reality/unreality."
* ''The reservation:'' the helmeted ''Spectrum Satrap'' (`03:1449`) stays a separate NPC caste —
  suited-and-glass-helmed para-humans of the Violet Steppe and the Black City, never elves.
  Kai ʻĀ may meet them; she does not read as one.

''Ch03 elf register'' (verbatim, for voice and render): "Angular beauty, void-shadowed eyes,
hair like moonlit ink or starlit fire" (`03:696`) · "a glamour that is both invitation and
warning" (`03:692`) · "voices like honey poured through crystal" (`03:698`). Which elf-clan
variant (if any) she carries — Void Envoy · Glass-Mask Courtier · Shadow Elf · none —
stays a table question.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/threads>>

!! Open Threads (Provisional — the table decides)

* ''Home turf:'' the standing read holds her as ''an arcane archer from Aki's home turf'' —
  a Shattered-Isles-adjacent thread binding her to Freyja's cluster; critical for the Caverns.
  Confirm or re-aim in talk-story.
* ''The hunt discipline:'' what a kaiju-stalker's craft looks like when the prey out-scales
  the hunter — trophy law, threat-reading, where the arcane rides in the archery.
* ''The bow:'' unnamed, unspecified — first canon belongs to Kai.
* ''Silhouette law'' (from the Aki concept package): "do not let the ranger and Aki merge
  visually" — Ranger = wilderness / hunt / kaiju-scale threat reading; Aki = shrine /
  threshold / veil. Hold the separation in every render.

<<~/ahu>>

